{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ASUf8GqTxPoEFNWpVfD9f8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FiZJZkuxVXVnmEuezwo8rV","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/telebot/projects/pocketcoder-a1/sandbox/test-verify/README.md","content":"# Calculator\n\nA simple Python calculator module providing basic arithmetic operations.\n\n## Functions\n\n### `add(a, b)`\n\nReturns the sum of two numbers.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import add\n\nadd(2, 3)      # 5\nadd(-1, 3)     # 2\nadd(1.5, 2.5)  # 4.0\n```\n\n### `subtract(a, b)`\n\nReturns the difference of two numbers.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import subtract\n\nsubtract(5, 3)    # 2\nsubtract(3, 5)    # -2\nsubtract(5.5, 2.5)  # 3.0\n```\n\n### `multiply(a, b)`\n\nReturns the product of two numbers.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import multiply\n\nmultiply(2, 3)    # 6\nmultiply(-2, 3)   # -6\nmultiply(2.5, 4)  # 10.0\n```\n\n### `divide(a, b)`\n\nReturns the quotient of two numbers. Raises `ValueError` if dividing by zero.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import divide\n\ndivide(6, 3)    # 2.0\ndivide(7, 2)    # 3.5\ndivide(0, 5)    # 0.0\ndivide(1, 0)    # raises ValueError: Cannot divide by zero\n```\n\n## Running Tests\n\n```bash\npytest -v\n```\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":165,"cache_read_input_tokens":34971,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":165},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1b3e142b-8fbf-4ac1-9647-a85e179619b2","uuid":"1dbb7017-0a4c-4e41-8ad3-c82dc4ee5212"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FiZJZkuxVXVnmEuezwo8rV","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/telebot/projects/pocketcoder-a1/sandbox/test-verify/README.md"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1b3e142b-8fbf-4ac1-9647-a85e179619b2","uuid":"2ed0924d-2e4a-4227-826a-b0881710af28","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/telebot/projects/pocketcoder-a1/sandbox/test-verify/README.md","content":"# Calculator\n\nA simple Python calculator module providing basic arithmetic operations.\n\n## Functions\n\n### `add(a, b)`\n\nReturns the sum of two numbers.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import add\n\nadd(2, 3)      # 5\nadd(-1, 3)     # 2\nadd(1.5, 2.5)  # 4.0\n```\n\n### `subtract(a, b)`\n\nReturns the difference of two numbers.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import subtract\n\nsubtract(5, 3)    # 2\nsubtract(3, 5)    # -2\nsubtract(5.5, 2.5)  # 3.0\n```\n\n### `multiply(a, b)`\n\nReturns the product of two numbers.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import multiply\n\nmultiply(2, 3)    # 6\nmultiply(-2, 3)   # -6\nmultiply(2.5, 4)  # 10.0\n```\n\n### `divide(a, b)`\n\nReturns the quotient of two numbers. Raises `ValueError` if dividing by zero.\n\n```python\nfrom calculator import divide\n\ndivide(6, 3)    # 2.0\ndivide(7, 2)    # 3.5\ndivide(0, 5)    # 0.0\ndivide(1, 0)    # raises ValueError: Cannot divide by zero\n```\n\n## Running Tests\n\n```bash\npytest -v\n```\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}
